{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20194","headline":"凭周况先辈於朝贤乞茶 · 孟郊","name":"凭周况先辈於朝贤乞茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道意勿乏味，心绪病无悰。\n蒙茗玉花尽，越瓯荷叶空。\n锦水有鲜色，蜀山饶芳藂。\n云根才翦绿，印缝已霏红。\n曾向贵人得，最将诗叟同。\n幸爲乞寄来，救此病劣躬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}